## Memory & Rules
- Four layers: built-in L1 · `AGENTS.md`/`SOUL.md` · Obsidian vault · session search
- L1 = pointers + tiny always-present facts only. Regular memory lives in `MEMORY.md` and vault files.
- Session-start reads `MEMORY.md` for regular memory (no L1 sync; L1 is hand-curated and stable)
- Working-context auto-refreshed at 03:55 local if >24h stale; AGENTS.md fails if >24h or daily-log gap >2d
- Gateway config changes need full restart

